WEBVTT

00:12:57.292 --> 00:13:01.855
have any chance to avoid
major catastrophes.

00:13:03.554 --> 00:13:04.998
Time is running out.

00:13:06.257 --> 00:13:09.526
We must act together, now.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:16.899
Otherwise, the next time
Nepal's cabinet meets on Mount Everest,

00:13:16.923 --> 00:13:19.226
that spectacular backdrop ...

00:13:20.534 --> 00:13:22.018
may look quite different.

00:13:25.316 --> 00:13:26.466
And if that happens,

00:13:28.031 --> 00:13:30.244
if our glaciers melt,